## fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.storageNetwork.icon=textures/fluffyalien/asn/ui/tutorial_book/storage_core_icon
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.storageNetwork.title=Storage Network
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.storageNetwork.bullet0=A network of devices that can hold an infinite amount of items.
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.storageNetwork.bullet1=Comprises one storage core and any number of storage drives. Can also contain many other optional devices.
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.storageNetwork.bullet2=Devices in the network must be placed next to each other or be connected with storage cables.
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.storageNetwork.bullet3=To get started, you will need one storage core, one storage drive, one storage disk, and one storage interface or wireless storage interface. Read their respective tutorial entries for more information.

## fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.storageCore.icon=textures/fluffyalien/asn/ui/tutorial_book/storage_core_icon
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.storageCore.title=Storage Core
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.storageCore.bullet0=The core of a storage network.
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.storageCore.bullet1=Required for a storage network to function.
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.storageCore.bullet2=Only one of these blocks exists in a network.

## fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.storageCable.icon=textures/fluffyalien/asn/ui/tutorial_book/storage_cable_icon
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.storageCable.title=Storage Cable
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.storageCable.bullet0=Connects devices in a storage network.

## fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.storageDrive.icon=textures/fluffyalien/asn/ui/tutorial_book/storage_drive_icon
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.storageDrive.title=Storage Drive
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.storageDrive.bullet0=Can store up to eight disks, which are what store items in a network.

## fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.storageInterface.icon=textures/fluffyalien/asn/ui/tutorial_book/storage_interface_icon
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.storageInterface.title=Storage Interface
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.storageInterface.bullet0=Allows players to add, remove, or view items in a storage network.

## fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.importBus.icon=textures/fluffyalien/asn/ui/tutorial_book/import_bus_icon
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.importBus.title=Storage Import Bus
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.importBus.bullet0=Imports items from the container it's facing into the storage network.
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.importBus.bullet1=Stops importing when receiving a redstone current.

## fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.exportBus.icon=textures/fluffyalien/asn/ui/tutorial_book/export_bus_icon
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.exportBus.title=Storage Export Bus
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.exportBus.bullet0=Exports items from the storage network into the container it's facing.
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.exportBus.bullet1=More filter options are available when exporting an item that is enchantable or breakable.
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.exportBus.bullet2=Stops exporting when receiving a redstone current.
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.exportBus.bullet3=Interact with an empty hand to configure.

## fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.levelEmitter.icon=textures/fluffyalien/asn/ui/tutorial_book/level_emitter_icon
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.levelEmitter.title=Storage Level Emitter
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.levelEmitter.bullet0=Tests that the total amount of a filtered set of item stacks in the storage network matches a query.
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.levelEmitter.bullet1=Filter options are available when exporting an item that is enchantable or breakable.
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.levelEmitter.bullet2=Activates the repeater in front of it when the test is true.
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.levelEmitter.bullet3=Interact with an empty hand to configure.

## fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.relay.icon=textures/fluffyalien/asn/ui/tutorial_book/storage_relay_icon
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.relay.title=Storage Relay
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.relay.bullet0=Connects storage network devices over long distances.
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.relay.bullet1=Interact to change the relay name.
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.relay.bullet2=Connects to all other relays with the same name.
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.relay.bullet3=Has infinite range and works interdimensionally.

## fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.powerBank.icon=textures/fluffyalien/asn/ui/tutorial_book/energy_icon
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.powerBank.title=Storage Power Bank
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.powerBank.bullet0=Stores energy for the network.

## fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.wirelessTransmitter.icon=textures/fluffyalien/asn/ui/tutorial_book/wireless_transmitter_icon
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.wirelessTransmitter.title=Storage Wireless Transmitter
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.wirelessTransmitter.bullet0=Allows a wireless interface to connect to a network.
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.wirelessTransmitter.bullet1=The default range is 500 blocks, this can be changed with the 'wirelessInterfaceRange' rule. See Add-On Configuration for more information.

## fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.wirelessInterface.icon=textures/fluffyalien/asn/items/wireless_interface
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.wirelessInterface.title=Wireless Storage Interface
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.wirelessInterface.bullet0=Allows players to add, remove, or view items in a storage network wirelessly.
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.wirelessInterface.bullet1=Interact with a storage core while holding this item to link it to that network.
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.wirelessInterface.bullet2=There must be a wireless transmitter connected to the linked network in range (500 blocks by default) to use the wireless interface. The range can be changed using the 'wirelessInterfaceRange' rule. See Add-On Configuration for more information.

## fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.storageDisks.icon=textures/fluffyalien/asn/items/storage_disk
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.storageDisks.title=Storage Disks
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.storageDisks.bullet0=A standard storage disk stores up to 32 item stacks. A high capacity storage disk stores up to 64.
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.storageDisks.bullet1=Put storage disks in a storage drive.

## fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.addonRules.icon=textures/fluffyalien/asn/ui/tutorial_book/storage_core_icon
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.addonRules.title=Add-On Configuration
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.addonRules.bullet0=Use the '/asnrule <rule> [value]' command to change a rule.
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.addonRules.bullet1=Use the '/asnrule help' command for a list of rules.
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.addonRules.bullet2=Omit '[value]' from the command to get the current value of the rule.
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.addonRules.bullet3=Note that numbers must be surrounded in quotation marks when passed to 'value' (eg. "123" instead of 123).

## fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.energy.icon=textures/fluffyalien/asn/ui/tutorial_book/energy_icon
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.energy.title=Energy
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.energy.bullet0=Energy usage is enabled by default, but can be disabled with the 'useEnergy' rule. See Add-On Configuration for more information.
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.energy.bullet1=Energy is stored in Storage Power Bank blocks.
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.energy.bullet2=Network energy consumption is determined by the amount of devices connected to the network. Device energy consumption can be changed using the 'deviceEnergyConsumption' rule. See Add-On Configuration for more information.
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.energy.bullet3=Uses Bedrock Energistics Core energy.
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.energy.bullet4=This add-on does not add any power generators, you must include another Bedrock Energistics Core powered add-on to generate energy for your system.

## fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidStorage.icon=textures/fluffyalien/asn/ui/tutorial_book/fluid_drive_icon
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidStorage.title=Fluid Storage
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidStorage.bullet0=Fluids are stored in Fluid Storage Drives and can be viewed through the Fluid Storage Interface.
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidStorage.bullet1=Uses Bedrock Energistics Core fluids.
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidStorage.bullet2=This add-on does not add any way to generate fluids, you must include another Bedrock Energistics Core powered add-on to generate fluids for your system.

## fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidDrive.icon=textures/fluffyalien/asn/ui/tutorial_book/fluid_drive_icon
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidDrive.title=Fluid Storage Drive
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidDrive.bullet0=Provides the network with 6,400 mL of fluid storage.
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidDrive.bullet1=Drops a Fluid Storage Disk when destroyed that contains the fluids the drive had before it was broken.

## fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidInterface.icon=textures/fluffyalien/asn/ui/tutorial_book/fluid_interface_icon
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidInterface.title=Fluid Storage Interface
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidInterface.bullet0=Allows players to view fluids in a storage network.

## fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidImportBus.icon=textures/fluffyalien/asn/ui/tutorial_book/fluid_import_bus_icon
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidImportBus.title=Fluid Storage Import Bus
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidImportBus.bullet0=Imports fluids from connected machines into the storage network.
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidImportBus.bullet1=Stops importing when receiving a redstone current.

## fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidExportBus.icon=textures/fluffyalien/asn/ui/tutorial_book/fluid_export_bus_icon
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidExportBus.title=Fluid Storage Export Bus
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidExportBus.bullet0=Exports fluids from the storage network into connected machines.
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidExportBus.bullet1=Stops exporting when receiving a redstone current.
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidExportBus.bullet2=Exports up to 1u/t.
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidExportBus.bullet3=Interact with an empty hand to configure.

## fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidStorageDisk.icon=textures/fluffyalien/asn/items/fluid_storage_disk
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidStorageDisk.title=Fluid Storage Disk
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidStorageDisk.bullet0=A crafting item.
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidStorageDisk.bullet1=Can contain data.
fluffyalien_asn.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidStorageDisk.bullet2=Interact with an empty fluid storage drive while holding a disk with data to deposit the fluids inside of the disk into the drive.